{"post_stream": {"posts": [{"id": 508772, "name": "Isaac Clarke", "username": "isaac0clarke", "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/discussion.fedoraproject.org/isaac0clarke/{size}/48182_2.png", "created_at": "2026-06-06T19:39:25.416Z", "cooked": "<p>I updated multiple PCs and read this (with the “replacing Steam” line in red).</p>\n<pre><code class=\"lang-plaintext\">Installing:\n steam-arch-transition                     noarch 0:1.0.0.85-10.fc44                rpmfusion-nonfree-upda   0.0   B\n   replacing steam                         i686   0:1.0.0.85-6.fc44                 &lt;unknown&gt;               19.4 MiB\nInstalling dependencies:\n openal-soft                               i686   0:1.24.2-6.fc44                   fedora                   1.7 MiB\n steam                                     x86_64 0:1.0.0.85-10.fc44                rpmfusion-nonfree-upda  19.4 MiB\n</code></pre>\n<p>Is this just the “no more 32bit libraries” update?</p>\n<p>Where can I, and anyone else, read (or watch, inform ourselves) more about this from <strong>recent</strong> sources?</p>", "post_number": 1, "post_type": 1, "posts_count": 9, "updated_at": "2026-06-06T19:39:25.416Z", "reply_count": 2, "reply_to_post_number": null, "quote_count": 0, "incoming_link_count": 949, "reads": 71, "readers_count": 70, "score": 4779.2, "yours": false, "topic_id": 193230, "topic_slug": "clarification-about-the-latest-steam-update-for-fedora-44-around-today", "display_username": "Isaac Clarke", "primary_group_name": null, "flair_name": null, "flair_url": null, "flair_bg_color": null, "flair_color": null, "flair_group_id": null, "badges_granted": [], "version": 1, "can_edit": false, "can_delete": false, "can_recover": false, "can_see_hidden_post": false, "can_wiki": false, "link_counts": [{"url": "https://discussion.fedoraproject.org/t/fixing-my-drivers-issues-may-have-broken-steam/193388/2", "internal": true, "reflection": true, "title": "Fixing my drivers issues may have broken Steam?", "clicks": 0}, {"url": "https://discussion.fedoraproject.org/t/indescribable-desktop-enviroment-dies-and-everything-unmounts-but-the-cursor-persists/201323/23", "internal": true, "reflection": true, "title": "Indescribable: Desktop Enviroment dies and everything unmounts, but the cursor persists", "clicks": 0}], "read": true, "user_title": null, "bookmarked": false, "actions_summary": [{"id": 2, "count": 1}], "moderator": false, "admin": false, "staff": false, "user_id": 23853, "hidden": false, "trust_level": 2, "deleted_at": null, "user_deleted": false, "edit_reason": null, "can_view_edit_history": true, "wiki": false, "mentioned_users": [], "post_url": "/t/clarification-about-the-latest-steam-update-for-fedora-44-around-today/193230/1", "event": null, "calendar_details": [], "reactions": [{"id": "heart", "type": "emoji", "count": 1}], "current_user_reaction": null, "reaction_users_count": 1, "current_user_used_main_reaction": false, "can_accept_answer": false, "can_unaccept_answer": false, "accepted_answer": false, "topic_accepted_answer": true}, {"id": 508775, "name": "MatH", "username": "theprogram", "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/discussion.fedoraproject.org/theprogram/{size}/53169_2.png", "created_at": "2026-06-06T19:42:23.819Z", "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"isaac0clarke\" data-display-name=\"Isaac Clarke\" data-post=\"1\" data-topic=\"193230\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://sea1.discourse-cdn.com/fedoraproject/user_avatar/discussion.fedoraproject.org/isaac0clarke/48/48182_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Isaac Clarke:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Is this just the “no more 32bit libraries” update?</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Interesting question.  I thought we had a solution to that, but I dont know.</p>\n<p>The other possibility is RPM Fusion being a bit out of sync, if that is the case, it will fix itself in a couple of days.</p>\n<p>Edit:  I tried to install Steam, for the first time, and no problems showed up.</p>", "post_number": 2, "post_type": 1, "posts_count": 9, "updated_at": "2026-06-06T19:43:29.104Z", "reply_count": 0, "reply_to_post_number": null, "quote_count": 1, "incoming_link_count": 29, "reads": 68, "readers_count": 67, "score": 158.6, "yours": false, "topic_id": 193230, "topic_slug": "clarification-about-the-latest-steam-update-for-fedora-44-around-today", "display_username": "MatH", "primary_group_name": null, "flair_name": "mindshare", "flair_url": "book-atlas", "flair_bg_color": "51a2daff", "flair_color": "", "flair_group_id": 63, "badges_granted": [], "version": 1, "can_edit": false, "can_delete": false, "can_recover": false, "can_see_hidden_post": false, "can_wiki": false, "read": true, "user_title": "Welcome Wagon", "title_is_group": false, "bookmarked": false, "actions_summary": [], "moderator": false, "admin": false, "staff": false, "user_id": 16174, "hidden": false, "trust_level": 4, "deleted_at": null, "user_deleted": false, "edit_reason": null, "can_view_edit_history": true, "wiki": false, "mentioned_users": [], "post_url": "/t/clarification-about-the-latest-steam-update-for-fedora-44-around-today/193230/2", "event": null, "reactions": [], "current_user_reaction": null, "reaction_users_count": 0, "current_user_used_main_reaction": false, "can_accept_answer": false, "can_unaccept_answer": false, "accepted_answer": false, "topic_accepted_answer": true}, {"id": 508781, "name": "novafunc", "username": "novafunc", "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/discussion.fedoraproject.org/novafunc/{size}/56093_2.png", "created_at": "2026-06-06T19:58:48.576Z", "cooked": "<p>Steam is working on a 64 bit client, this Fedora packaging update is just a reflection of that.</p>\n<p>The package type has been made 64-bit, but it still uses the 32-bit Steam client and 32-bit libraries.</p>", "post_number": 3, "post_type": 1, "posts_count": 9, "updated_at": "2026-06-06T19:58:48.576Z", "reply_count": 0, "reply_to_post_number": null, "quote_count": 0, "incoming_link_count": 15, "reads": 66, "readers_count": 65, "score": 103.2, "yours": false, "topic_id": 193230, "topic_slug": "clarification-about-the-latest-steam-update-for-fedora-44-around-today", "display_username": "novafunc", "primary_group_name": null, "flair_name": null, "flair_url": null, "flair_bg_color": null, "flair_color": null, "flair_group_id": null, "badges_granted": [], "version": 1, "can_edit": false, "can_delete": false, "can_recover": false, "can_see_hidden_post": false, "can_wiki": false, "read": true, "user_title": "", "bookmarked": false, "actions_summary": [{"id": 2, "count": 1}], "moderator": false, "admin": false, "staff": false, "user_id": 33317, "hidden": false, "trust_level": 2, "deleted_at": null, "user_deleted": false, "edit_reason": null, "can_view_edit_history": true, "wiki": false, "mentioned_users": [], "post_url": "/t/clarification-about-the-latest-steam-update-for-fedora-44-around-today/193230/3", "event": null, "reactions": [{"id": "bluethumb", "type": "emoji", "count": 1}], "current_user_reaction": null, "reaction_users_count": 1, "current_user_used_main_reaction": false, "can_accept_answer": false, "can_unaccept_answer": false, "accepted_answer": false, "topic_accepted_answer": true}, {"id": 508789, "name": "Jeff V", "username": "computersavvy", "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/discussion.fedoraproject.org/computersavvy/{size}/4741_2.png", "created_at": "2026-06-06T20:12:28.634Z", "cooked": "<p>I did an update today and it installed the steam-arch-transition package and replaced the older steam-0:1.0.0.85-6.fc44.i686 package with no errors.</p>", "post_number": 4, "post_type": 1, "posts_count": 9, "updated_at": "2026-06-06T20:12:28.634Z", "reply_count": 0, "reply_to_post_number": null, "quote_count": 0, "incoming_link_count": 3, "reads": 64, "readers_count": 63, "score": 27.8, "yours": false, "topic_id": 193230, "topic_slug": "clarification-about-the-latest-steam-update-for-fedora-44-around-today", "display_username": "Jeff V", "primary_group_name": "ask-fedora", "flair_name": "ask-fedora", "flair_url": null, "flair_bg_color": "", "flair_color": "", "flair_group_id": 53, "badges_granted": [], "version": 1, "can_edit": false, "can_delete": false, "can_recover": false, "can_see_hidden_post": false, "can_wiki": false, "read": true, "user_title": "Q&A Leader", "title_is_group": false, "bookmarked": false, "actions_summary": [], "moderator": true, "admin": false, "staff": true, "user_id": 3019, "hidden": false, "trust_level": 4, "deleted_at": null, "user_deleted": false, "edit_reason": null, "can_view_edit_history": true, "wiki": false, "mentioned_users": [], "post_url": "/t/clarification-about-the-latest-steam-update-for-fedora-44-around-today/193230/4", "event": null, "reactions": [], "current_user_reaction": null, "reaction_users_count": 0, "current_user_used_main_reaction": false, "can_accept_answer": false, "can_unaccept_answer": false, "accepted_answer": false, "topic_accepted_answer": true}, {"id": 508803, "name": "Tim Casey", "username": "timjcasey", "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/discussion.fedoraproject.org/timjcasey/{size}/55520_2.png", "created_at": "2026-06-06T23:15:44.077Z", "cooked": "<p>Installed those last night and have not had any issues, 32bit still there.</p>", "post_number": 5, "post_type": 1, "posts_count": 9, "updated_at": "2026-06-06T23:15:44.077Z", "reply_count": 0, "reply_to_post_number": null, "quote_count": 0, "incoming_link_count": 14, "reads": 58, "readers_count": 57, "score": 81.6, "yours": false, "topic_id": 193230, "topic_slug": "clarification-about-the-latest-steam-update-for-fedora-44-around-today", "display_username": "Tim Casey", "primary_group_name": null, "flair_name": null, "flair_url": null, "flair_bg_color": null, "flair_color": null, "flair_group_id": null, "badges_granted": [], "version": 1, "can_edit": false, "can_delete": false, "can_recover": false, "can_see_hidden_post": false, "can_wiki": false, "read": true, "user_title": null, "bookmarked": false, "actions_summary": [], "moderator": false, "admin": false, "staff": false, "user_id": 3631, "hidden": false, "trust_level": 1, "deleted_at": null, "user_deleted": false, "edit_reason": null, "can_view_edit_history": true, "wiki": false, "mentioned_users": [], "post_url": "/t/clarification-about-the-latest-steam-update-for-fedora-44-around-today/193230/5", "event": null, "reactions": [], "current_user_reaction": null, "reaction_users_count": 0, "current_user_used_main_reaction": false, "can_accept_answer": false, "can_unaccept_answer": false, "accepted_answer": false, "topic_accepted_answer": true}, {"id": 508812, "name": "Francis Montagnac", "username": "francismontagnac", "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/discussion.fedoraproject.org/francismontagnac/{size}/51683_2.png", "created_at": "2026-06-07T06:05:03.071Z", "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"isaac0clarke\" data-display-name=\"Isaac Clarke\" data-post=\"1\" data-topic=\"193230\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://sea1.discourse-cdn.com/fedoraproject/user_avatar/discussion.fedoraproject.org/isaac0clarke/48/48182_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Isaac Clarke:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Where can I, and anyone else, read (or watch, inform ourselves) more about this from <strong>recent</strong> sources?</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p><code>dnf info</code> or <code>dnf changelog</code> may help. In this case:</p>\n<pre><code class=\"lang-plaintext\">dnf info steam-arch-transition\n[...]\nDescription    : This package is used to migrate Steam installations from the\n               : legacy i686 package layout to the x86_64 package layout.\n               : \n               : It exists only to handle package replacement and dependency\n               : changes during upgrades, and can be safely removed once the\n               : transition is complete.\n</code></pre>", "post_number": 6, "post_type": 1, "posts_count": 9, "updated_at": "2026-06-07T06:05:03.071Z", "reply_count": 2, "reply_to_post_number": null, "quote_count": 1, "incoming_link_count": 28, "reads": 51, "readers_count": 50, "score": 190.2, "yours": false, "topic_id": 193230, "topic_slug": "clarification-about-the-latest-steam-update-for-fedora-44-around-today", "display_username": "Francis Montagnac", "primary_group_name": null, "flair_name": null, "flair_url": null, "flair_bg_color": null, "flair_color": null, "flair_group_id": null, "badges_granted": [], "version": 1, "can_edit": false, "can_delete": false, "can_recover": false, "can_see_hidden_post": false, "can_wiki": false, "read": true, "user_title": null, "bookmarked": false, "actions_summary": [{"id": 2, "count": 2}], "moderator": false, "admin": false, "staff": false, "user_id": 29619, "hidden": false, "trust_level": 2, "deleted_at": null, "user_deleted": false, "edit_reason": null, "can_view_edit_history": true, "wiki": false, "mentioned_users": [], "post_url": "/t/clarification-about-the-latest-steam-update-for-fedora-44-around-today/193230/6", "event": null, "reactions": [{"id": "heart", "type": "emoji", "count": 2}], "current_user_reaction": null, "reaction_users_count": 2, "current_user_used_main_reaction": false, "can_accept_answer": false, "can_unaccept_answer": false, "accepted_answer": true, "topic_accepted_answer": true}, {"id": 508816, "name": "Isaac Clarke", "username": "isaac0clarke", "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/discussion.fedoraproject.org/isaac0clarke/{size}/48182_2.png", "created_at": "2026-06-07T06:34:31.768Z", "cooked": "<p>Thanks.</p>\n<p>This is basically the answer I was looking for.</p>", "post_number": 7, "post_type": 1, "posts_count": 9, "updated_at": "2026-06-07T06:34:31.768Z", "reply_count": 0, "reply_to_post_number": 6, "quote_count": 0, "incoming_link_count": 13, "reads": 44, "readers_count": 43, "score": 73.8, "yours": false, "topic_id": 193230, "topic_slug": "clarification-about-the-latest-steam-update-for-fedora-44-around-today", "display_username": "Isaac Clarke", "primary_group_name": null, "flair_name": null, "flair_url": null, "flair_bg_color": null, "flair_color": null, "flair_group_id": null, "badges_granted": [], "version": 1, "can_edit": false, "can_delete": false, "can_recover": false, "can_see_hidden_post": false, "can_wiki": false, "read": true, "user_title": null, "reply_to_user": {"id": 29619, "username": "francismontagnac", "name": "Francis Montagnac", "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/discussion.fedoraproject.org/francismontagnac/{size}/51683_2.png"}, "bookmarked": false, "actions_summary": [], "moderator": false, "admin": false, "staff": false, "user_id": 23853, "hidden": false, "trust_level": 2, "deleted_at": null, "user_deleted": false, "edit_reason": null, "can_view_edit_history": true, "wiki": false, "mentioned_users": [], "post_url": "/t/clarification-about-the-latest-steam-update-for-fedora-44-around-today/193230/7", "event": null, "reactions": [], "current_user_reaction": null, "reaction_users_count": 0, "current_user_used_main_reaction": false, "can_accept_answer": false, "can_unaccept_answer": false, "accepted_answer": false, "topic_accepted_answer": true}, {"id": 508829, "name": "Jose Villani", "username": "josevillani", "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/discussion.fedoraproject.org/josevillani/{size}/53338_2.png", "created_at": "2026-06-07T09:04:39.791Z", "cooked": "<p>Didn’t complete the operation, but at first look, it doesn’t look like a good idea.</p>\n<pre data-code-wrap=\"bash\"><code class=\"lang-bash\">$ LANG=C sudo dnf remove steam-arch-transition\nPackage                                             Arch       Version                                             Repository                               Size\nRemoving:\n steam-arch-transition                              noarch     0:1.0.0.85-10.fc44                                  rpmfusion-nonfree-updates             0.0   B\nRemoving unused dependencies:\n libICE                                             i686       0:1.1.2-4.fc44                                      fedora                              197.2 KiB\n libnsl                                             i686       0:2.43-6.fc44                                       updates                             105.2 KiB\n libnsl                                             x86_64     0:2.43-6.fc44                                       updates                             101.8 KiB\n ntsync-autoload                                    noarch     0:11.0-3.fc44                                       fedora                                7.0   B\n steam                                              x86_64     0:1.0.0.85-10.fc44                                  rpmfusion-nonfree-updates            19.4 MiB\n steam-devices                                      noarch     0:1.0.0.101^git20260123.39e7bd0-8.fc44              updates                              14.9 KiB\n\nTransaction Summary:\n Removing:           7 packages\n\nAfter this operation, 20 MiB will be freed (install 0 B, remove 20 MiB).\nIs this ok [Y/n]: n\nOperation aborted by the user.\n\n</code></pre>", "post_number": 8, "post_type": 1, "posts_count": 9, "updated_at": "2026-06-07T09:05:15.839Z", "reply_count": 1, "reply_to_post_number": 6, "quote_count": 0, "incoming_link_count": 16, "reads": 39, "readers_count": 38, "score": 92.8, "yours": false, "topic_id": 193230, "topic_slug": "clarification-about-the-latest-steam-update-for-fedora-44-around-today", "display_username": "Jose Villani", "primary_group_name": null, "flair_name": null, "flair_url": null, "flair_bg_color": null, "flair_color": null, "flair_group_id": null, "badges_granted": [], "version": 1, "can_edit": false, "can_delete": false, "can_recover": false, "can_see_hidden_post": false, "can_wiki": false, "read": true, "user_title": null, "reply_to_user": {"id": 29619, "username": "francismontagnac", "name": "Francis Montagnac", "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/discussion.fedoraproject.org/francismontagnac/{size}/51683_2.png"}, "bookmarked": false, "actions_summary": [], "moderator": false, "admin": false, "staff": false, "user_id": 17296, "hidden": false, "trust_level": 2, "deleted_at": null, "user_deleted": false, "edit_reason": null, "can_view_edit_history": true, "wiki": false, "mentioned_users": [], "post_url": "/t/clarification-about-the-latest-steam-update-for-fedora-44-around-today/193230/8", "event": null, "reactions": [], "current_user_reaction": null, "reaction_users_count": 0, "current_user_used_main_reaction": false, "can_accept_answer": false, "can_unaccept_answer": false, "accepted_answer": false, "topic_accepted_answer": true}, {"id": 508840, "name": "Francis Montagnac", "username": "francismontagnac", "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/discussion.fedoraproject.org/francismontagnac/{size}/51683_2.png", "created_at": "2026-06-07T10:22:28.427Z", "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group quote-modified\" data-username=\"josevillani\" data-display-name=\"Jose Villani\" data-post=\"8\" data-topic=\"193230\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://sea1.discourse-cdn.com/fedoraproject/user_avatar/discussion.fedoraproject.org/josevillani/48/53338_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Jose Villani:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>it doesn’t look like a good idea.</p>\n<pre><code class=\"lang-plaintext\">$ LANG=C sudo dnf remove steam-arch-transition\n[...]\nRemoving unused dependencies:\n[...]\n steam                                              x86_64     0:1.0.0.85-10.fc44                                  rpmfusion-nonfree-updates            19.4 MiB\n\n</code></pre>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Effectively. either (I think, not tested):</p>\n<ul>\n<li>use <code>dnf remove --no-autoremove</code></li>\n<li>mark steam as user installed with <code>dnf mark user steam</code></li>\n</ul>", "post_number": 9, "post_type": 1, "posts_count": 9, "updated_at": "2026-06-07T